WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.420
Regional manager says, “Why are we wasting all this time on television?

2
00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.600
What are we wasting all these dollars for?”

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.400
And I said to him, “Can we prove it to him?”

4
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:18.860
So we had, here’s Nancy Nation, for National Food.

5
00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.140
Betty Gaillard, I don’t know if you knew Betty.

6
00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:26.920
She used to be society editor of the [Times-]Picayune.

7
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:40.520
At any rate, we decided that . . . when she did the commercial, she held up a Domino Sugar five-pound bag.

8
00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:41.300
Okay.

9
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:55.620
She said, “This will not be advertised on television or in the newspaper, but you must ask the cashier for this at twenty-nine cents.”

10
00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.800
Which was a bargain.

11
00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.420
You know, it was selling for sixty-nine or something like that.

12
00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:03.760
So, she did it.

13
00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.560
They ran out of, oh God, ran out of sugar.

14
00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:13.220
And the guy said, “Stop it, I’m convinced.”

15
00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:16.780
And that convinced him that television was a viable tool.
